  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>셩<ruby>쉬<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>훼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_SY3mhilBIs?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>冷淡<rt>롕ˆ담ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>使<rt>수ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑-</rt></ruby><ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e liêng-tām, sû-lang-kâm-kak\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>熱情<rt>뗻졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>欠債<rt>캼ˋ제</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà’e riet-jiéng si-khiàm-je\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>所有<rt>서ˆ우-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>疼惜<rt>턀ˋ숗</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>간<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>나<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>笑詼<rt>쵸ˋ퀘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sôr-u-thià̰-sioh, kān-nā-si-chiò-khuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>原諒<rt>꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>頭<rt>ᄐᅷ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>一擺<rt>짇배ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>對<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>反背<rt>환ˆ붸ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goan-liong-lî-thau-jit-pài, tùi-ai’e hoân-puē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>跳<rt>ᄐᆤˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>入<rt>띱ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>心酸<rt>심ˉ승ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>大<rt>돠-</rt></ruby><ruby>火<rt>훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà tio-thiàu-rîp, sīm-sn̂g’e toa-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>重<rt>당ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>慐<rt>껑ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-jiéng rû-tāng, rû-lai-rû-gōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>事實<rt>수싣ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>像<rt>츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>痟<rt>ᄉᆤˋ</rt></ruby>’에\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-bó su-sît chiṵ-siàu’e\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一直<rt>읻ˆ딛-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>做夢<rt>죄ˋ빵ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>生活<rt>솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ît-tit-joè-bāng, siēng-oâh khâh-hô-kue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hiâh\">遐<rt>햫ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>殘忍<rt>잔띰ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>老實<rt>ᄅᅷ싣-</rt></ruby><ruby>話<rt>웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì nà tioh-hiâh-jan-rìm, kông-lau-sit-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>連<rt>롄-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>搬<rt>봘ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>幸福<rt>혱헉</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>願<rt>꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>奉陪<rt>헝붸ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lien-kôh-poā̰-hieng-hork, lông-m-goan-hong-pué\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>鑿<rt>착-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>流血<rt>ᄅᅷ휗</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, na-si-chak-tioh-sîm ma-e-lau-hueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>浪漫<rt>렁빤ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>忽然<rt>훋ˆ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby>間<rt>간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>變<rt>볜ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>風吹<rt>헝ˉ췌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    long-bān’e ai, hût-rien-kân pièn-hōng-chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>失眠<rt>싣ˆ삔ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>幾<rt>귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>暝<rt>메ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>流<rt>ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-koân-sît-bín kûi-loh-mé, goâ-bak-sài lau-roa-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>猶原<rt>유ˉ꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>發<rt>홛ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>覺<rt>각</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>苦<rt>커ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>苦<rt>커ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>留戀<rt>류롼ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>夯枷<rt>꺄게ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yū-goan-bo-hoât-kak, khôr-khôr-liu-loán si-gia-ké\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>飛<rt>붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>解說<rt>개ˆ쉫</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, bêh-puē-khoà̰-sīm-jiéng bo-kâi-sueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>寂寞<rt>셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>情批<rt>졩풰ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà’e siôrk-bôrk, si-hor-lì’e jieng-phuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>罵<rt>메-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>太<rt>태ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>狼狽<rt>령붸ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>玲瑯<rt>린ˉ렁ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pieng-yù me-goà thài-liong-puē, tuè-tioh-lì līn-lōng-sêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>度過<rt>더궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烏暗<rt>어ˉ암</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>明月<rt>뼹뀋ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jāi-lì si-goà, tor-kuè-ōr-am’e bieng-guêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>幾<rt>귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>段<rt>돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>坎坎坷坷<rt>캄ˆ캄ˆ켿켿ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kûi-toa̰-kâm-jiéng khâm-khâm-khiet-khiêt\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>早<rt>자ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>貧惰<rt>빈돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>求<rt>규-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥貨<rt>샬ˆ훼</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jà tio-pin-toa̰-kiu-siâ̰-hue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>出現<rt>춛ˆ혠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>改變<rt>개ˆ볜</rt></ruby>’<ruby>ᄅᆤ<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e chût-hiēn kâi-pien’liàu ît-che\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>飄浪<rt>ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>變做<rt>볜ˋ죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goâ-phiāu-lōng’e kōr-toâ̰ pièn-joè-u-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>緣份<rt>옌훈ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>遐邇<rt>햫ˆ니</rt></ruby><ruby>短<rt>데ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    nà jāi-làn’e yen-hūn e-hiâh-ni-tè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>飛<rt>붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>解說<rt>개ˆ쉫</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, bêh-puē-khoà̰-sīm-jiéng bo-kâi-sueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>寂寞<rt>셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>情批<rt>졩풰ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà’e siôrk-bôrk, si-hor-lì’e jieng-phuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>苦勸<rt>커ˆ킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>清醒<rt>촁ˉ첼ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>假<rt>게ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pieng-yù khôr-khǹg-goà chiēng-chḛ̀, lì’e jiéng lông-si-kè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>度過<rt>더궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烏暗<rt>어ˉ암</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>明月<rt>뼹뀋ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jāi-lì si-goà, tor-kuè-ōr-am’e bieng-guêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>鑿<rt>착-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>流血<rt>ᄅᅷ휗</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, na-si-chak-tioh-sîm ma-e-lau-hueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>浪漫<rt>렁빤ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>忽然<rt>훋ˆ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby>間<rt>간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>變<rt>볜ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>風吹<rt>헝ˉ췌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    long-bān’e ai, hût-rien-kân pièn-hōng-chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>失眠<rt>싣ˆ삔ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>幾<rt>귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>暝<rt>메ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>流<rt>ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-koân-sît-bín kûi-loh-mé, goâ-bak-sài lau-roa-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>猶原<rt>유ˉ꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>發<rt>홛ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>覺<rt>각</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>苦<rt>커ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>苦<rt>커ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>留戀<rt>류롼ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>夯枷<rt>꺄게ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yū-goan-bo-hoât-kak, khôr-khôr-liu-loán si-gia-ké\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>飛<rt>붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>解說<rt>개ˆ쉫</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, bêh-puē-khoà̰-sīm-jiéng bo-kâi-sueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>寂寞<rt>셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>情批<rt>졩풰ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà’e siôrk-bôrk, si-hor-lì’e jieng-phuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>罵<rt>메-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>太<rt>태ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>狼狽<rt>령붸ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>玲瑯<rt>린ˉ렁ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pieng-yù me-goà thài-liong-puē, tuè-tioh-lì līn-lōng-sêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>度過<rt>더궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烏暗<rt>어ˉ암</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>明月<rt>뼹뀋ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jāi-lì si-goà, tor-kuè-ōr-am’e bieng-guêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>毒<rt>덕ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>變卦<rt>볜ˋ과</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>情話<rt>졩웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-tôrk’e bî-lē, si-e-pièn-koa’e jieng-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
}
